{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-po06",
  "version": "0.6.0-beta.9",
  "private": true,
  "description": "dsh-prompt-optimizer 0.6 beta（P1–P8）：意图解释与状态投影、质量展开编译、共享澄清、长任务、有限验证与返工门、灰度与配置迁移/回滚。**默认不启用**——装配期启用闸门保守取 off，且旧版插件仍在装配时会以 DOUBLE_INTERCEPT 拒绝启用。⚠ **尚无效果证据**：留出评估只跑完 S1，且没有任何可信判据显示两臂有差别；未验证项见 po06/RELEASE-CHECKLIST.md。**private 保持 true**：不发布到 npm，只发 GitHub Release 附件，避免把这个未经效果验证的原型误发上公共注册表。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc <5"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "cordis": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "eval/HOLDOUT-v2.md",
    "eval/HOLDOUT-v1.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    }
  }
}
